    "https://careers.viu.ca/vacancy/opportunity-profile-provost-and-vicepresident-academic-603913.html": {
      "title": "OPPORTUNITY PROFILE: Provost and Vice-President Academic (3030)",
      "description": "OPPORTUNITY PROFILE: Provost and Vice-President Academic (3030) | VIU | Vancouver Island University Skip to main content VIU Future Students International Students Current Students Employees Alumni & Donors Contact Registration Registration Space tasks Map Members Space Structure Registration Site map Parents viu.ca Sections Pages All Sites... All Groups... Site Members Registration Member list Admins admin boquist culvers manhasm2 testuser Members No members OPPORTUNITY PROFILE: Provost and Vice-President Academic (3030) OPPORTUNITY PROFILE: Provost and Vice-President Academic Vancouver Island University (VIU) is pleased to partner with an external search firm in the recruitment of a Provost and Vice-President Academic. This is an exciting leadership opportunity to provide leadership for the academic mission and direction of the institution. At a pivotal moment of academic transformation, the Provost and Vice-President Academic will play a central role in shaping the University’s future academic landscape – guiding program renewal, fostering interdisciplinary collaboration, strengthening academic quality and ensuring that VIU’s educational offerings remain responsive to the evolving needs of learners, communities and the workforce. The role also carries significant responsibility for advancing Indigenous engagement and reconciliation, supporting collegial governance and aligning academic priorities with the institution’s long-term strategic and financial sustainability. We invite you to learn more about this role and the impact it will have in shaping VIU’s next chapter by reviewing the attached opportunity profile. Please note that all inquiries and applications are being managed directly through the search firm, as outlined in the profile. As outlined in the profile, this search is being supported by Boyden . Employment Group ADMIN Position Number 10001 Division Provost and Vice-President Academic Department Office of the Provost Campus Nanaimo campus  *Successful candidates must be able to attend in person on campus as required. Location Nanaimo, British Columbia Country Canada Appointment Type regular full-time Additional Information Open until filled. Applications will be reviewed September 2026. Posted Date 13-Aug-2026 Job Reference 3030 Documents Opportunity Profile (Word , 58.15kb) To explore this opportunity further and apply, please visit the Boyden site directly. Apply for this job Print this job Send to a friend About VIU Careers at VIU Employee Directory Parking Academics International Students Library Programs and Courses VIU Learn Campuses Nanaimo (Main Campus) Cowichan Parksville-Qualicum Centre tiwšɛmawtxʷ (Powell River) About VIU Why VIU? Careers at VIU Employee Directory VIU Facts Events News Parking University Governance Academics Admission Requirements Dual Credit Financial Aid and Awards Graduate Programs International Students Library Online Education Programs and Courses Registration Transfer Students VIU Learn Student Life Student Housing Campus Recreation Campus Store Food Services Health and Wellness Services for Students VIU Mariners Athletics Campuses Campus Information Nanaimo (Main Campus) Cowichan Parksville-Qualicum Centre tiwšɛmawtxʷ (Powell River) Vancouver Island University Nanaimo (Main Campus) 900 Fifth Street Nanaimo, BC V9R 5S5 Canada 250.753.3245 1.888.920.2221 info@viu.ca Facebook Instagram Twitter Youtube LinkedIn VIU RSS feed The VIU community acknowledges and thanks the Snuneymuxw, Quw’utsun and Tla’amin, on whose traditional lands we teach, learn,\n                                                                                        research, live and share knowledge. Accreditation Terms Emergency Information Website Feedback © 2021 Vancouver Island University MENU CLOSE X Future Students International Students Current Students Employees Alumni & Donors Contact VIU Main Menu Open submenu (About VIU) About VIU Open submenu (Programs and Courses) Programs and