nagement Culinary Arts Bridging to Bachelor of Hospitality Management Event Management Certificate Hospitality Management Diploma Master of Arts in Sustainable Leisure Management Recreation and Sport Management Graduate Diploma in Sustainable Leisure Management Tourism Studies Wine Business Certificate in Adventure Tourism and Recreation Close submenu (Trades and Applied Technology) Trades and Applied Technology Aboriginal Construction Aluminum Boat Building Applied Business Technology - Online Automotive Service Technician Carpentry Culinary Arts Culinary Management Electrician First Nations Housing Manager Hairdressing Heavy Equipment Operator Heavy Mechanical Trades Foundation Horticultral Technician Foundation Information Technology and Applied Systems Motorcycle and Marine Technician Power Engineering/Process Operator - 4th Class Professional Baking and Pastry Arts Refrigeration Air-Conditioning Mechanic Welding Close submenu (Admissions) Admissions Open submenu (Admission Requirements) Admission Requirements Open submenu (Tuition & Fees) Tuition & Fees Financial Aid & Awards Apply Now Close submenu (Admission Requirements) Admission Requirements Requirements Equivalencies and Advanced Placement Program How to Order Transcripts Close submenu (Tuition & Fees) Tuition & Fees Fees Tuition Payment of Fees Careers Login Register Current vacancies"
