      "title": "Academic and Career Preparation and High School Equivalency (ABE)",
      "description": "Academic and Career Preparation and High School Equivalency (ABE) | Vancouver Island University | Canada Skip to main content Program search icon Search Menu About Programs Admissions & Aid Student Life Support VIU Research About About Get to know VIU. As a teaching university and a research university, we offer a unique experience to students. About VIU Why VIU About VIU President's Office Indigenous Education and Engagement Department Directory Governance, Administration and Planning Accreditation Careers Contact Us Why VIU? Equity, Diversity, Inclusion and Accessibility Sustainability News Events Key Facts Explore VIU's impact From classrooms to research and community engagement, the VIU community's impact is worth celebrating. VIU Impact Report Programs Programs Explore a wide range of program offerings and learning services. Choose from degrees, vocational training, certificates and more. Find your program Learning Services Programs Learning at VIU Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Trades and Applied Technology Programs Academic and Career Preparation programs Professional and Life Long Learning Learning Services Advising Centre Upgrading support Library Talk to a recruiter Explore your options with one of our friendly recruiters. Online and in-person meetings available. Connect with a recruiter Admissions & Aid Admissions & Aid Discover how to apply to VIU and get more information about tuition and financial aid. Admissions Tuition and Aid Admissions VIU Admissions Transfer Admissions Mature Students and Adult Learner Admissions Events and Information Sessions Tuition and Aid VIU Tuition and Aid Scholarships, Awards & Bursaries Student Loans and Grants External Awards and Funding Tuition and Fees How to become a student Make your VIU application successful by following these steps to becoming a student. Steps to become a student Student Life Student Life Make the best of your time at VIU. Get involved in campus events and enjoy island adventures. Student Life Student Services Student Life VIU Mariners Athletics Get to Know Vancouver Island Recreation Co-Curricular Engagement Student Housing Events Calendar Student Services and Support Experiential Learning Accessibility Services Learning Matters Campus Store Food Services Health and Wellness Get ready for the new student orientation Attend in-person and online events, explore campus and connect with your professors and soon-to-be classmates! RockVIU Support VIU Support VIU Connect with other VIU alumni and learn about the impact of donor generosity at VIU. Give VIU Alumni Alumni VIU Alumni Benefits VIU Donors Giving to VIU VIU Foundation Student Success Stories Your support means so much to VIU students Our donors fund over 2000 scholarships, awards, and bursaries each year. Research Research Discover how VIU's interdisciplinary research is making a real-world impact. Research Research Centres and Institutes News and Events VIU Expert List Undergraduate Research Explore VIU's impact From classrooms to research and community engagement, the VIU community's impact is worth celebrating. VIU Impact Report Search VIU Search Search icon Apply to VIU Request Info Information for Future Students Current Students International Students Parents and Families Employees and Faculty Alumni Donors Quick links My Student Record Course Timetables VIULearn Library Parking Health and Wellness Centre Technology @ VIU Employee Portal Campuses Nanaimo (Main Campus) Cowichan tiwšɛmawtxʷ (Powell River) Academic and Career Preparation and High School Equivalency (ABE) Breadcrumb Programs and Courses Areas of Study Menu CLOSE X OG menu Programs and Courses Areas of Study Open submenu Courses Start Your Application Close submenu Areas of Study Academic and Career Preparation and High School Equivalency (ABE) Art, Design and Performing Arts Arts, Humanities and Social Sciences Business and Management Co-operative Education Education English Language Learning (ELL) Exploratory University Studies (EXPO) Graduate and Post-degree Programs Health Sciences Human Services Indigenous Online Programs and Courses Professional Development and Training Science, Engineering, and Technology Programs Tourism, Recreation and Hospitality Trades and Applied Technology Access site pages through the menu. Got it! Apply You’re ready to come back to school and make your dreams come true. It is quite possible that you are in a job or pursuing activities you cannot imagine doing for the rest of your life. Whatever the reason, you are ready for this challenge. Whether you are missing prerequisites, want to finish high school, or need to prepare for success in an academic program, get started on a path that helps you get to where you want to go – no matter what career or goal you might have in mind. You will gain new confidence in your abilities, and find that you are soon making progress and feeling more confident with the full support of caring, dedicated instructors. Maybe you have something standing in the way of what you imagine for yourself? This is the start of a positive conversation with an Educational Advisor who will help you find a way to make your goals possible and encourage you to take steps that will be supported all the way to your completion of a course or program. Certificate Adult Basic Education (ABE) Cooperative Entrepreneur Training Certificate Foundations for Success Indigenous University Bridging Workplace Essential Skills and Training Non-Credit BC Adult Graduation Diploma Employability Skills Program VIU also offers literacy programs to provide Math and English courses to students who need fundamental skills. FAQs phone-square phone-square icon Connect with Us! Phone or email us info-circle info-circle icon Events and Info Sessions View events pen-square pen-square icon Ready to join us at VIU? Start Your application facebook-square Facebook instagram Instagram youtube Youtube linkedin Linked-in bluesky Bluesky Vancouver Island U